  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING DUAL-WORLD BALLROOM: You walk in Silver while your Reflection walks in Black across a horizontal glass wall. Link the Blue Portals, flip worlds to smuggle the North Light Orb to the South primer socket, flip back, align against the glass, and fire Lantern Beam so your Gold Beam and your Reflection's Blue-banked Beam ring the Mirror Chord simultaneously!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Opposite-world mirror_avatar synchronization, cross-glass portal smuggling, and simultaneous dual-color beam chord mastery.",
    "decisions": 11,
    "expert_s": 65,
    "reward": "palace_mirror_chord+palace_balcony_short+moth_7_06",
    "why": "Signature astonishing room of The Inverted Palace unlocking the False Throne vault, NE Foyer balcony shortcut, and Lost Moth 6.",
    "exit": "exit_r10_balc",
